        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This resolution expresses condolences to the families, friends, and loved ones of the victims of UPS Airlines flight 2976, which crashed in Louisville, Kentucky,&nbsp;on November 4, 2025.</p><p>The resolution&nbsp;also</p><ul><li>honors those who lost their lives, and</li><li>commends the first responders and emergency personnel.</li></ul>",
